# Asinine Antics at sorcery speed (CR 601.2b, 601.2f, 118.8). With six mana in hand (Mox Sapphire, Mox Jet, Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl,
# Mox Emerald and an Island) the question "Flash: Pay {2} more" is asked, though nothing needs it (the rulings allow it): on
# turn 3 Bot1 pays it, all six sources tapped, and the mana value is still four (CR 202.3). On turn 5 the second Antics is cast
# for {2}{U}{U} alone: the extra is declined and the Mox Pearl and Mox Emerald stay untapped.

